<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Spin</Major>
    <Description>Activate this macro script to quickly spin your character in Roblox.
Only works in 3rd-person camera as 1st-person camera requires the mouse to spin while this macro script uses the keyboard to spin.

To Spin: Activate macro
To Stop: Deactivate macro (will continue to spin until you stop it)

Screen Resolution: 1920 x 1080
Game: Roblox
Works on: Any experience that allows 3-rd person camera.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
